#!/bin/sh
# Local guard (phase 11, user decision): `main` only changes through a GitHub pull request
# (rebase-merge). While the repository is private on GitHub Free, branch protection is not
# available, so this hook + the `main-guard` CI job are the soft enforcement.
# Install once per clone: pnpm hooks:install. Emergency override: ALLOW_PUSH_TO_MAIN=1 git push …
while read -r _local_ref _local_sha remote_ref _remote_sha; do
  if [ "$remote_ref" = "refs/heads/main" ] && [ "${ALLOW_PUSH_TO_MAIN:-0}" != "1" ]; then
    echo "pre-push: direct pushes to main are not allowed — open a pull request instead." >&2
    echo "pre-push: (emergency only: ALLOW_PUSH_TO_MAIN=1 git push …)" >&2
    exit 1
  fi
done
exit 0
